WEBVTT

00:01:58.997 --> 00:02:01.251
we can't see them without a microscope,

00:02:01.275 --> 00:02:03.385
and you guys might know
bacteria and viruses

00:02:03.409 --> 00:02:04.973
because they both make us sick.

00:02:05.536 --> 00:02:07.432
But what a lot of people don't know

00:02:07.456 --> 00:02:11.218
is that viruses
can also make bacteria sick."

00:02:12.059 --> 00:02:14.535
Now, the story
that I start telling my kids,

00:02:14.559 --> 00:02:17.646
it starts out like a horror story.

00:02:18.887 --> 00:02:21.880
Once upon a time,
there's this happy little bacterium.

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:23.957
Don't get too attached to him.

00:02:23.981 --> 00:02:25.673
(Laughter)

00:02:25.697 --> 00:02:28.363
Maybe he's floating around in your stomach

00:02:28.387 --> 00:02:30.561
or in some spoiled food somewhere,